'''Ingredients Sellers''' (Japanese: '''食材屋''' ''Ingredient Seller'') are [[Non-player character|NPC]]s who sell [[ingredient]]s for making [[curry]]. Ingredients Sellers can be found in the [[Wild Area]] and on the [[Isle of Armor]]. They have the appearance of {{tc|Hiker}}s.

==In the core series games==
Three Ingredients Sellers can be found in fixed locations across the [[Galar]] [[region]]:
*[[Rolling Fields]], by a tree across from the [[Meetup Spot]]
*[[Hammerlocke Hills]], next to the entrance to [[Hammerlocke]]
*[[Fields of Honor]], by the farmland in front of the [[Master Dojo]] (after the {{player}} enters the dojo for the first time)

Each Ingredients Seller has a pool of ingredients to sell from, and their stock changes daily.

===Rolling Fields===
This Ingredients Seller sells six items at a time: three items from the {{pdollar}}150 pool, two or three items from the {{pdollar}}400 pool, and up to one item from the {{pdollar}}950 pool.
