===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|JN}}====
An Ingredients Seller appeared in ''[[JN101|A One-Stick Wonder!]]'', supplying Ash and [[Goh]] with [[curry]] ingredients while they were camping out in the [[Wild Area]]. In the dub, he was simply referred to as a {{tc|Hiker}}.

===''Pokémon Horizons: The Series''===
Another Ingredients Seller appeared in ''[[HZ027|As Long as I'm with My Friends]]'', selling curry ingredients to [[Liko]], [[Roy]], and [[Dot]].

